sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EnergyTransferStarted

    CS->>CSMS: ClearedChargingLimitRequest (chargingLimitSource = EMS)
    CSMS-->>CS: ClearedChargingLimitResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = ChargingRateChanged)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
